# 🚀 Day 43 – AI Workflow Architect

## 📌 Challenge Overview

For **Day 43** of the **60 Days Claude AI Challenge by ABTalks**, I built **⚙️ AI Workflow Architect**, a premium workflow planning platform that transforms complex business processes into structured, AI-powered execution frameworks.

Instead of generating generic advice or simple checklists, this application creates a complete **end-to-end workflow**—from planning to execution—tailored to a specific role, process, or business objective.

---

# 🎯 Project Objective

Build an intelligent workflow platform that helps users:

- Design structured workflows
- Understand every stage of execution
- Discover the best AI tools for each task
- Learn best practices
- Avoid common mistakes
- Improve productivity through automation

